SUMMARY:Sustainability Pop-Up by FIFA Green Corridor
DTSTAMP:20260715T051907Z
DTSTART:20260715T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Stop by Lake Plaza on Wednesday\, July 15\, from 9 a.m. to 1 p.
	m. for a special Sustainability Pop-Up as part of the FIFA Green Corridor\
	, featuring Harris County Pollution Control\, the Harris County Air Qualit
	y Monitoring Van\, H-GAC\, and Hermann Park Conservancy. \nLearn how local
	 partners are working together to support cleaner air\, healthier habitats
	\, and a more sustainable future for Houston.\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/e
	vent/sustainability-pop-up-by-fifa-green-corridor/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Co
	nservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sustainability-pop-up-by-fifa-green-corri
	dor/
LOCATION:Lake Plaza
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
