	l and Health Fair presented by Shell provides 20\,000 Houston area student
	s with the tools they need to start the school year off right. In addition
	 to distributing 20\,000 backpacks with school supplies\, the event will f
	eature on-site health screenings to include: dental screenings and sealant
	s\, vision screenings\, mental health screenings\, and routine immunizatio
	ns. The event also connects families to a wide range of health and social 
	services offered by community agencies. \nWhere:\nGeorge R. Brown Conventi
	on Center\n\nhttps://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/mayors-back-2-s
